# draw_graph example: the plan for draw_graph itself, drawn as a graph.
#
# One file mixes the four kinds of graph the app is for:
#   learning path   tools to learn first          Edge Kind requires
#   flowchart       how a save is checked         Edge Kind flow
#   mind map        what the app is for            Edge Kind branch
#   concept map     how the parts relate           Edge Kind relates
#
# Record types:
#   Group   a box on the canvas; Parent nests it in another box
#   Node    one node; its fields come from the %type lines below
#   Edge    one arrow; From and To name nodes
#   View    a saved way of looking at the graph (layout, root, folds)
#
# %graph lines are draw_graph settings. recfix ignores them; the app
# reads them as rules and styles. A rule is checked on every edit, and an
# edit that breaks one is refused.

%rec: Group
%key: Name
%type: Parent rec Group
%type: Color regexp /^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/
%type: Collapsed enum yes no
%mandatory: Name
%allowed: Name Label Parent Color Collapsed Note
%graph: parent Parent

Name: Learning
Label: Learning path
Color: #1f4f6f

Name: Languages
Parent: Learning

Name: Frameworks
Parent: Learning

Name: App
Label: draw_graph app
Color: #3a2f5f

Name: Backend
Label: Backend (Rust)
Parent: App

Name: Frontend
Label: Frontend (web view)
Parent: App

Name: Canvas
Parent: Frontend
Note: Everything drawn on the canvas.
+ Collapsed by default so the Frontend box stays small.
Collapsed: yes

Name: Save flow
Label: How a save is checked
Color: #5f4f1f

Name: Ideas
Label: What it is for
Color: #1f5f46

%rec: Node
%key: Name
%type: Kind enum tool task step decision start end idea concept
%type: Level range 1 5
%type: Tier enum base extra max
%type: Status enum todo doing done
%type: Group rec Group
%type: Color regexp /^#[0-9a-f]{6}$/
%type: Shape enum box round diamond ellipse
%type: Pos regexp /^-?[0-9]+ -?[0-9]+$/
%mandatory: Name Kind
%allowed: Name Label Kind Level Tier Status Group Color Shape Url Note Pos
%graph: label Label Name
%graph: color Level
%graph: shape Kind tool=round task=box step=box decision=diamond start=ellipse end=ellipse idea=round concept=round
%graph: pos Pos
%graph: group Group
%graph: filter Tier

