%rec: View
%key: Name
%type: Layout enum layered tree radial force manual
%type: Direction enum right down left up
%type: Root rec Node
%type: Follow enum out in
%type: Repeat enum fold full
%mandatory: Name Layout
%allowed: Name Layout Direction Root Follow Edges Filter Collapse Repeat Note
# Repeat is how a tree view shows a node it reaches a second time (a node
# with several parents). fold, the default: the first copy shows its whole
# branch, every later copy starts folded and carries a "same as above"
# marker that jumps to the first; za still unfolds it. full: every copy
# shows its whole branch, so branches multiply down a chain.

Name: Learning path
Layout: layered
Direction: right
Edges: requires
Filter: Kind = 'tool'
Note: Like dev_tools_path.svg: columns by Level, left to right.

Name: Build tree
Layout: tree
Direction: down
Root: Tauri
Follow: out
Edges: requires
Collapse: rec parser
Repeat: fold
Note: Everything Tauri unlocks, as a tree. Release builds
+ shows three times, once under each parent: in full under
+ the first, folded with "same as above" under the other two.
+ rec parser starts folded too.

Name: What Tree view needs
Layout: tree
Direction: up
Root: Tree view
Follow: in
Edges: requires
Repeat: full
Note: The same edges walked backwards: every prerequisite of Tree view.
+ Small enough to show every copy in full.

Name: Save flow
Layout: layered
Direction: down
Edges: flow
Filter: Group = 'Save flow'

Name: Mind map
Layout: radial
Root: draw_graph
Edges: branch relates
Collapse: Live reload
Collapse: Small diffs

Name: Everything
Layout: manual
Note: Saved Pos for every node; groups as nested boxes.
